plugin-hostd (0.22.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release: plugin-hostd 0.22.4 (0.22.3 to 0.22.4), a patch
  * tests: a qualification store fixture is at the user_version the library's
    header declares, never a 1 kept here
  * release: a staged dispatch builds the full matrix of its arch-matrix
  * tests: ci_guards holds release.yml's push arm to the full matrix
  * release: a push builds the trixie deb for amd64 and arm64, the full matrix
  * own-host page: the LV2 audio probe connects to the ports the instance
    publishes, not to in_N/out_N
  * own-host page: a plugin with no verdict runs after pin_accept (R-112), so
    each block accepts it before its first verb
  * ci: the own-host page job prints the daemon's and its workers' logs when
    the page stops
  * tests: the bundle-ports sabotage arm breaks the read as it is written
    since the memory-ran-out answer (7d0848c7)
  * release: plugin-hostd 0.22.3 (0.22.2 to 0.22.3), a patch
  * pins: settings that name no pin_file read /var/lib/omx/qualified.pins,
    the file the qualification sync writes
  * ci: the own-host page, run off main, reads staging and the wave's devel
    channel beside the page's channel
  * ci: no Debian bookworm cell (owner 2026-11-27: bookworm is dropped from
    the matrix)
  * ci: the JACK2 job installs jack-example-tools only where Debian has it
  * ci: a dispatch off main in a wave reads that wave's devel channel too, as
    it reads staging
  * ci: a pull request into devel in a wave reads that wave's devel channel
    above staging
  * release: the same-pass list goes, its one entry plugin-hostd-full is no
    package now
  * qualification domain: unmeasuredReason, the reason a figure was not
    measured
  * release: plugin-hostd 0.22.2 (0.22.1 to 0.22.2), a patch
  * ci: the development package's requires carry the floor the build stamped,
    and the file-list check reads it
  * lv2: the bundle and port reading say when memory ran out, and the page
    and param verbs answer it
  * schema ids: the check walks the tree, since CI's container checkout
    refuses git (exit 128)
  * schemas: every $id names https://openmixer.org/schema/plugin-hostd/
    (omx-contract#106)
  * describe test: the omx-contract arm runs only when OMX_CONTRACT_CLI and
    OMX_CONTRACT_DATA both name something

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Sat, 28 Nov 2026 07:32:14 +0000
